# Runtime artifacts this pair emits INTO its own directory — never the frozen
# design/instrument files themselves. (The defect fixed in 9dc5da13: a launcher
# whose own runtime files collide with its own dirty-guard.)
#
# ⚠️ EVERY PATTERN IS ROOT-ANCHORED (leading `/`), deliberately. An unanchored
# `PINNED_SRC_REV` would also swallow `selftest_fixture/*/PINNED_SRC_REV`,
# which are FROZEN FIXTURE FILES the selftest reads and must stay TRACKED.
/RUN_LIVE_*.json
/PINNED_SRC_REV
/SMOKE_tiny_*.json
/SMOKE_prod_*.json
/VERDICT.json
/budget44k_launch.log
/*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
